  "id": "gingerbread-cake-with-lemon-glaze",
  "name": "Gingerbread Cake with Lemon Glaze",
  "subtitle": "Warmly spiced cake finished with a bright lemon drizzle",
  "description": "A tender molasses gingerbread baked as a simple square cake and topped with a tart lemon glaze.",
